        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>It is a constant static effect, so while Tachyon&#39;s move value can be reduced to 1, The World Stands Still would increase it to 2.</p><p>It is irrelevant to the actual dice roll, and can turn a 6 movement into a 7 movement while in play.</p><p>Also if it leaves play its effect immediately ends, so it doesn&#39;t affect the roll, but just adds 1 to her current movement while it is in play.</p>",
